<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 78 0 R
/T (Low-code platforms inherently obscure underlying engine execution code. Auditing low-code applications for stringent regulatory compliance standards \(such as SOC 2 Type II, HIPAA, GDPR, or ISO 27001\) relies heavily on the platform vendor's security certifications rather than direct line-by- line source code inspection. In contrast, traditional software codebases allow full static application security testing \(SAST\), dynamic testing \(DAST\), and precise vulnerability remediation.)
/E (Low-code platforms inherently obscure underlying engine execution code. Auditing low-code applications for stringent regulatory compliance standards \(such as SOC 2 Type II, HIPAA, GDPR, or ISO 27001\) relies heavily on the platform vendor's security certifications rather than direct line-by- line source code inspection. In contrast, traditional software codebases allow full static application security testing \(SAST\), dynamic testing \(DAST\), and precise vulnerability remediation.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
